{"id":"U17","title":"Exercise and the Aging Heart","titleZh":"运动与衰老的心脏","paras":[{"id":"U17-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U17-P1-S1","hard":true,"text":"As we age, even if we're healthy, the heart just isn't as efficient in processing oxygen as it used to be."},{"id":"U17-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"In most people the first signs show up in their 50s or early 60s."},{"id":"U17-P1-S3","hard":false,"text":"And among people who don't exercise, the changes can start even sooner."}],"zh":"随着年龄增长，即使我们很健康，心脏处理氧气的效率也不如从前了。在大多数人身上，最初的迹象出现在50多岁或60岁出头。而在不运动的人群中，这种变化甚至可能更早开始。"},{"id":"U17-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U17-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"\"Think of a rubber band."},{"id":"U17-P2-S2","hard":false,"text":"In the beginning, it is flexible, but put it in a drawer for 20 years and it will become dry and easily broken,\" says Dr. Ben Levine, a heart specialist at the University of Texas."},{"id":"U17-P2-S3","hard":false,"text":"That's what happens to the heart."},{"id":"U17-P2-S4","hard":false,"text":"Fortunately for those in midlife, Levine is finding that even if you haven't been an enthusiastic exerciser, getting in shape now may help improve your aging heart."}],"zh":"\"想想一根橡皮筋。一开始，它是有弹性的，但把它放在抽屉里20年，它就会变干、容易断裂，\"德克萨斯大学的心脏专家本·莱文博士说。\"心脏就是这样。\"幸运的是，对于中年人来说，莱文发现即使你一直不是一个热衷锻炼的人，现在开始健身也可能有助于改善你衰老的心脏。"},{"id":"U17-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U17-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"Levine and his research team selected volunteers aged between 45 and 64 who did not exercise much but were otherwise healthy."},{"id":"U17-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"Participants were randomly divided into two groups."},{"id":"U17-P3-S3","hard":false,"text":"The first group participated in a program of nonaerobic exercise--balance training and weight training--three times a week."},{"id":"U17-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"The second group did high-intensity aerobic exercise under the guidance of a trainer for four or more days a week."},{"id":"U17-P3-S5","hard":false,"text":"After two years, the second group saw remarkable improvements in heart health."}],"zh":"莱文和他的研究团队挑选了年龄在45至64岁之间、平时不怎么锻炼但除此之外很健康的志愿者。参与者被随机分成两组。第一组参加了一个非有氧运动项目——平衡训练和重量训练——每周三次。第二组在教练的指导下进行高强度有氧运动，每周四天或更多。两年后，第二组在心脏健康方面看到了显著的改善。"},{"id":"U17-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U17-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"\"We took these 50-year-old hearts and turned the clock back to 30- or 35-year-old hearts,\" says Levine."},{"id":"U17-P4-S2","hard":true,"text":"\"And the reason they got so much stronger and fitter was that their hearts could now fill a lot better and pump a lot more blood during exercise.\""},{"id":"U17-P4-S3","hard":false,"text":"But the hearts of those who participated in less intense exercise didn't change, he says."}],"zh":"\"我们把这些50岁的心脏变成了30或35岁的心脏，\"莱文说。\"它们变得如此强壮和健康的原因是，现在它们的心脏在运动时能够更好地充盈，泵出更多的血液。\"但他说，那些参加强度较低运动的人的心脏没有变化。"},{"id":"U17-P5","sentences":[{"id":"U17-P5-S1","hard":false,"text":"\"The sweet spot in life to start exercising, if you haven't already, is in late middle age when the heart still has flexibility,\" Levine says."},{"id":"U17-P5-S2","hard":false,"text":"\"We put healthy 70-year-olds through a year-long exercise training program, and nothing happened to them at all.\""},{"id":"U17-P5-S3","hard":false,"text":"Dr. Nieca Goldberg, a spokeswoman for the American Heart Association, says Levine's findings are a great start."},{"id":"U17-P5-S4","hard":false,"text":"But the study was small and needs to be repeated with far larger groups of people to determine exactly which aspects of an exercise routine make the biggest difference."}],"zh":"\"如果你还没有开始锻炼，人生中开始锻炼的最佳时机是在中年晚期，那时心脏仍然具有弹性，\"莱文说。\"我们让健康的70岁老人参加了一年的运动训练项目，但他们的心脏完全没有变化。\"美国心脏协会发言人妮卡·戈德伯格博士说，莱文的发现是一个很好的开端。但这项研究规模较小，需要在更大的人群中重复进行，以准确确定锻炼常规的哪些方面产生最大的影响。"}],"words":[{"id":"U17-W01","lemma":"age","surface":"age","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 变老; 老化 n. 年龄; 时代","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"as we age","zh":"随着我们变老"},{"en":"at the age of","zh":"在...岁时"}]},{"id":"U17-W02","lemma":"even","surface":"even","pos":"adv. / adj.","zh":"adv. 即使; 甚至 adj. 平坦的; 偶数的","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"even if","zh":"即使"},{"en":"even though","zh":"虽然"}]},{"id":"U17-W03","lemma":"heart","surface":"heart","pos":"n.","zh":"心脏; 心; 中心","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"heart health","zh":"心脏健康"},{"en":"by heart","zh":"凭记忆"}]},{"id":"U17-W04","lemma":"efficient","surface":"efficient","pos":"adj.","zh":"高效的; 有效率的","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"energy efficient","zh":"节能的"},{"en":"efficient in","zh":"在...方面高效"}]},{"id":"U17-W05","lemma":"process","surface":"processing","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 处理; 加工 n. 过程; 进程","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"process information","zh":"处理信息"}]},{"id":"U17-W06","lemma":"oxygen","surface":"oxygen","pos":"n.","zh":"氧气","sent":"U17-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"process oxygen","zh":"处理氧气"},{"en":"oxygen level","zh":"氧气水平"}]},{"id":"U17-W07","lemma":"think","surface":"Think","pos":"v.","zh":"想; 思考; 认为","sent":"U17-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"think of","zh":"想到; 考虑"},{"en":"think about","zh":"思考"}]},{"id":"U17-W08","lemma":"rubber band","surface":"rubber band","pos":"phr.","zh":"橡皮筋","sent":"U17-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"a rubber band","zh":"一根橡皮筋"}]},{"id":"U17-W09","lemma":"flexible","surface":"flexible","pos":"adj.","zh":"有弹性的; 灵活的","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"flexible schedule","zh":"灵活的时间表"}]},{"id":"U17-W10","lemma":"drawer","surface":"drawer","pos":"n.","zh":"抽屉","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"in a drawer","zh":"在抽屉里"}]},{"id":"U17-W11","lemma":"year","surface":"years","pos":"n.","zh":"年; 年份","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"for 20 years","zh":"20年"}]},{"id":"U17-W12","lemma":"dry","surface":"dry","pos":"adj. / v.","zh":"adj. 干燥的; 干巴巴的 v. 使干燥","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"dry skin","zh":"干燥的皮肤"}]},{"id":"U17-W13","lemma":"break","surface":"broken","pos":"v. / adj.","zh":"v. 打破; 折断 adj. 破碎的; 坏掉的","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"easily broken","zh":"容易断裂"}]},{"id":"U17-W14","lemma":"specialist","surface":"specialist","pos":"n.","zh":"专家; 专科医生","sent":"U17-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"heart specialist","zh":"心脏专家"}]},{"id":"U17-W15","lemma":"fortunately","surface":"Fortunately","pos":"adv.","zh":"幸运地; 幸好","sent":"U17-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"fortunately for","zh":"对...来说幸运的是"}]},{"id":"U17-W16","lemma":"midlife","surface":"midlife","pos":"n.","zh":"中年; 中年时期","sent":"U17-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"in midlife","zh":"在中年"}]},{"id":"U17-W17","lemma":"enthusiastic","surface":"enthusiastic","pos":"adj.","zh":"热情的; 热心的","sent":"U17-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"enthusiastic about","zh":"对...热情"},{"en":"enthusiastic exerciser","zh":"热衷锻炼的人"}]},{"id":"U17-W18","lemma":"shape","surface":"shape","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 形状; 身材; 状态 v. 塑造; 成形","sent":"U17-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"get in shape","zh":"健身; 保持身材"},{"en":"in good shape","zh":"状态良好"}]},{"id":"U17-W19","lemma":"select","surface":"selected","pos":"v. / adj.","zh":"v. 挑选; 选择 adj. 精选的","sent":"U17-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"select volunteers","zh":"挑选志愿者"}]},{"id":"U17-W20","lemma":"otherwise","surface":"otherwise","pos":"adv. / conj.","zh":"adv. 否则; 除此之外 conj. 否则","sent":"U17-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"otherwise healthy","zh":"除此之外很健康"}]},{"id":"U17-W21","lemma":"participant","surface":"Participants","pos":"n.","zh":"参与者; 参加者","sent":"U17-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"study participants","zh":"研究参与者"}]},{"id":"U17-W22","lemma":"randomly","surface":"randomly","pos":"adv.","zh":"随机地; 任意地","sent":"U17-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"randomly divided","zh":"随机分配"}]},{"id":"U17-W23","lemma":"divide","surface":"divided","pos":"v.","zh":"划分; 分开; 除以","sent":"U17-P3-S2","phrases":[{"en":"divide into","zh":"分成..."},{"en":"divided by","zh":"除以"}]},{"id":"U17-W24","lemma":"participate","surface":"participated","pos":"v.","zh":"参加; 参与","sent":"U17-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"participate in","zh":"参加..."}]},{"id":"U17-W25","lemma":"program","surface":"program","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 项目; 节目; 程序 v. 编程","sent":"U17-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"exercise program","zh":"运动项目"},{"en":"training program","zh":"训练项目"}]},{"id":"U1