ith","zh":"充满..."},{"en":"fill out","zh":"填写"}]},{"id":"U17-W38","lemma":"pump","surface":"pump","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 泵送; pumping n. 泵; 抽水机","sent":"U17-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"pump blood","zh":"泵血"},{"en":"heart pump","zh":"心脏泵"}]},{"id":"U17-W39","lemma":"blood","surface":"blood","pos":"n.","zh":"血液; 血统","sent":"U17-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"pump blood","zh":"泵血"},{"en":"high blood pressure","zh":"高血压"}]},{"id":"U17-W40","lemma":"during","surface":"during","pos":"prep.","zh":"在...期间","sent":"U17-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"during exercise","zh":"在运动时"}]},{"id":"U17-W41","lemma":"intense","surface":"intense","pos":"adj.","zh":"强烈的; 剧烈的; 紧张的","sent":"U17-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"intense exercise","zh":"剧烈运动"},{"en":"intense heat","zh":"酷热"}]},{"id":"U17-W42","lemma":"sweet spot","surface":"sweet spot","pos":"phr.","zh":"最佳点; 最佳时机","sent":"U17-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"the sweet spot","zh":"最佳时机"}]},{"id":"U17-W43","lemma":"already","surface":"already","pos":"adv.","zh":"已经; 早已","sent":"U17-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"have already","zh":"已经"}]},{"id":"U17-W44","lemma":"year-long","surface":"year-long","pos":"adj.","zh":"持续一年的; 全年的","sent":"U17-P5-S2","phrases":[{"en":"a year-long program","zh":"为期一年的项目"}]},{"id":"U17-W45","lemma":"spokeswoman","surface":"spokeswoman","pos":"n.","zh":"女发言人","sent":"U17-P5-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a spokeswoman for","zh":"...的女发言人"}]},{"id":"U17-W46","lemma":"repeat","surface":"repeated","pos":"v.","zh":"重复; 重做","sent":"U17-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"needs to be repeated","zh":"需要被重复"}]},{"id":"U17-W47","lemma":"exactly","surface":"exactly","pos":"adv.","zh":"精确地; 确切地; 正好","sent":"U17-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"not exactly","zh":"不完全是"}]},{"id":"U17-W48","lemma":"aspect","surface":"aspects","pos":"n.","zh":"方面; 层面","sent":"U17-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"all aspects of","zh":"...的各个方面"},{"en":"different aspects","zh":"不同方面"}]},{"id":"U17-W49","lemma":"routine","surface":"routine","pos":"n. / adj.","zh":"n. 常规; 惯例; 例行程序 adj. 常规的; 例行的","sent":"U17-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"exercise routine","zh":"锻炼常规"},{"en":"daily routine","zh":"日常惯例"}]},{"id":"U17-W50","lemma":"difference","surface":"difference","pos":"n.","zh":"差异; 区别; 影响","sent":"U17-P5-S4","phrases":[{"en":"make a difference","zh":"产生影响; 起作用"},{"en":"make the biggest difference","zh":"产生最大的影响"}]}],"_v":1786413566727}